Entó:s tehwa tikmatisneki ke:ní:w mochi:wa se: ma:se:walkali.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="7.656" endTime="8.549">
<Sync time="7.656"/>
'Ne:chilwi.
